        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s3"
      },
      "text": "Based on our investigation, the actors behind Operation C­Major were able to keep their Android malware on Google Play for months and they advertised their apps on Facebook pages which have thousands of likes from high profile targets.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
