      },
      "text": "More malicious apps Since at least early 2013, actors behind Operation C­Major have been using a variety of malicious apps against high­profile targets in the Indian military, as well as other foreign embassies.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
